00:09:38,181 --> 00:09:44,181
Pixels is a action, comedy, science fiction film directed by Chris Columbus.

3
00:14:27,272 --> 00:14:33,272
Video game experts are recruited by the military to fight
1980s-era video game characters who've attacked New York.

4
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:22,363
Brenner, played by Adam Sandler.

5
00:24:05,454 --> 00:24:11,454
Cooper, played by Kevin James.

6
